      "content": "thanks for that. one thing though, i've heard some people say the train can feel more \"chaotic\" or unpredictable during peak hours compared to a flight schedule. do you think the station crowds or the sheer volume of people on the Shinkansen could make it a stressful way to travel for a business trip? or is it pretty smooth?",
