      "role": "user",
      "content": "fair enough. one last thing—i'm a bit worried about my luggage. i'll have two large suitcases. i've heard that the train stations can get really hectic with people pushing through, and i'm worried about my bags getting lost or mishandled in the crowd. is there anything else i should watch out for regarding transit efficiency or unexpected issues?",
